@version 1

/// Bounded identity leaf narrowed from selectTernaryBridge in
/// packages-ts/galerina-ext-bridge-cpp/src/index.ts.
///
/// Both BitNetGpuBridge and BitNetCpuBridge expose the fixed technique identity
/// "ternary". The TypeScript selector itself constructs native bridge objects,
/// probes hardware, loads an optional addon, and creates governance state; those
/// active state and host/provider effects remain in the TypeScript shadow.
/// This flow reports only the shared identity and performs no bridge selection,
/// inference, native loading, socket/transport work, or authority grant.

pure flow selectTernaryBridgeTechnique() -> String
contract { intent { "Return the fixed technique identity shared by the CPU and GPU ternary bridge implementations." } }
{
  return "ternary"
}
